{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/286124-purview-ideas","id":286124,"title":"Purview Ideas?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-18T13:21:22-07:00","id":286124,"title":"Purview Ideas?","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\">So I was wondering if there were any other types of Purviews that people have come up with that aren't included in the normal set<b>. </b>I thought up of a possibility for Volcanoes and Emotions, and would have done more, but the Order idea seemed too close to Justice, and the Forge idea didn't seem worth it. I couldn't think of 10 powers between them, but I did come up with a basic premise and an Avatar State (hah!) for the two of them.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Volcano Purview:</b> Those who wield the awesome power of the volcano are some of the most fearsome gods in the realms. Magma courses beneath the earth like blood through the veins, and they can harness this magma for their own ends. When they invoke this purview, the ground explodes like a minefield, volcanic ash threatens to blot out the sun, super heated rock is rained down from the sky, and the landscape is decimated almost beyond repair. Such is the terrible might of the Volcano gods, who channel the destructive rage of the planet itself.<br /> <br /> <br /> Avatar of the Volcano (The Cataclysm): Rare is the need to invoke this great being, but when it happens, it is like the apocalypse has come to earth. For one scene, the Scion becomes the blood of the land, a vast network of lava flowing beneath the planet's crust. At their will, this lava surges to the surface in an explosive display, shattering the earth beneath the enemy's feet and spraying them with a geyser of molten rock Which can sear even a Titan's flesh if they are caught by it. Clouds of ash fill the air, blotting out most forms of light, as well as choking those who inhale, and threatening to encase them in mummified prisons. Fire rains from the sky like meteors and the landscape will never be the same without further divine intervention!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Emotion Purview:</b> Gods of love, hatred, terror, greed and more have been heard of throughout history. The Emotion Purview is the ability to ignite and control the desires of those around you. Scions who wield such power are able to feed upon the emotional energy of those around them, or magnify it to levels that are nearly impossible to control. More than a few evil deities have used this purview to drive mortals to sin, but good deities have also used it to bolster their resolve against temptations.<br /> <br /> Avatar of Emotion (The Bacchanal): For one scene, the scion becomes the very embodiment of emotion. Their body dissolves into a cloud of narcotic, pink mist which permeates the area, intoxicating anyone who inhales it. The Bacchanal drives those assembled into a maelstrom of emotional outbursts, causing them to lose their senses as they hurl themselves into whatever vices grip them at the moment with primal abandon. Even the Titans may forget what they are doing and lose themselves to an emotional outburst, giving their enemies time to strike while they are distracted. Or perhaps the Titans will even turn on each other if they have repressed aggression towards their fellows! The Bacchanal is able to manipulate the mist at their will, so those who they do not wish to intoxicate may pass safely through. After the scene ends, the vict</span>ims have no memory of what transpired, as if they were lost in a trance... or just black out drunk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T17:34:56-07:00","id":286273,"title":"","content":"<b>Expansion Purview:</b> In your life time, if you've paid any attention to legends and fantasy, you've probably heard of characters who were &quot;giants of men&quot; or &quot;larger than life&quot; when describing them. The Expansion Purview allows its wielders the gift of exaggerated size and reach. A wielder of Expansion can strike foes at a distance, by extending the range at which their weapons inflict damage, resulting in legends of swordsmen who cleaved a mountain in two with one swing of their blades. They can achieve mythical proportions, crushing legions of enemies under their boots, or smash through their enemy fortresses with the fist of an angry god. Few beings are as imposing as a high level master of Expansion!<br /> <br /> <br /> Avatar of Expansion (The World Wrecker): The Scion becomes the embodiment of expansion for one scene. They grow to impossible scale, their head towering over the clouds. Their blows can shatter islands and split continents, and if they rage out of control, they endanger the planet with their fury. The blows from The World Wrecker do not merely end upon initial landing, but continue forward up to a number of miles equal to the user's Legend. As the World Wrecker, they can pulverize mountain ranges, gouge canyons into the earth, their footsteps leave behind craters. In the events following a battle in which The World Wrecker has participated, the field of battle becomes the sight of a natural monument or a world wonder!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T19:49:53-07:00","id":286330,"title":"","content":"I've had ideas based on a different system for deity level characters I created for it.<br /> <br /> Or to quote from my on stuff (The height of arrogance I know)<br /> <i>...snip<br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">the &quot;classical&quot; elements as just a paltry few of the building blocks of the multiverse. {redacted] tends to view the elementals in a lesser way as a human sees any &quot;dumb&quot; beast. The elemental lords hate him for it. [redacted] has ever preferred to deal with proto-elemental creations that are endowed with &quot;spirit&quot; or a soul, as opposed to simple anima. (Beings with depth. A perfect example of such a proto-elemental creation is Yggdrasil, the World Tree, of which can be ranked among the proto-elemental lords of the multiverse) </span><br /> <br /> ...snip<br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><i>The bindings of light and dark have their utility but they are inanimate constructs. As is shadow. Day and Night are symbols that are alive. And while some may think I am a product of their union, they are wrong. I am the Fires within Dark and Light and shadow is my plaything. What shines between the phases are razor-edged. A prime creation that enables multi-dimensionality. Me. You. Them. Us. We are one. </i></span></i><br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">----------------------------<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">*shrugs*<br /> I play with symbolism a lot.</span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T23:52:19-07:00","id":286451,"title":"","content":"There are several variations on Forge (Industry, Creation, Artisan, etc) and several variations on Emotion floating around. There's a semi-official Sound Purview, and at least one variation on that. A few attempts at Wealth (or Abundance). Good thing someone created a sticky post on this very forum filled with fan-written Scion projects!!<br /> <br /> Volcano doesn't really seem to be a Purview. It's just Fire and Earth. Mostly Fire. Purviews are BIG, massive, fundamental things.<br /> <br /> As for a Purview only about turning into a Giant... that seems really just like some Epic Stamina or Strength Knacks, not a whole Purview. It's really only one or two powers. And many people have re-written Jotunblut to include abilities that make you get super-big.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T13:06:23-07:00","id":286870,"title":"","content":"If I had to add only two purviews to Scion, I'd go with Emotion and Wealth. When I was STing, I really wished that they existed. Forge is another essential one too, but my players weren't really the crafter-type.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T13:35:10-07:00","id":286890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/286124-purview-ideas?p=286451#post286451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are several variations on Forge (Industry, Creation, Artisan, etc) and several variations on Emotion floating around. There's a semi-official Sound Purview, and at least one variation on that. A few attempts at Wealth (or Abundance). Good thing someone created a sticky post on this very forum filled with fan-written Scion projects!!<br /> <br /> Volcano doesn't really seem to be a Purview. It's just Fire and Earth. Mostly Fire. Purviews are BIG, massive, fundamental things.<br /> <br /> As for a Purview only about turning into a Giant... that seems really just like some Epic Stamina or Strength Knacks, not a whole Purview. It's really only one or two powers. And many people have re-written Jotunblut to include abilities that make you get super-big.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well it wasn't just about growing big, it was also about increasing somebody's reach. Such as making attacks effect a large area, or to continue traveling long after they should have stopped. For example, a samurai swings their sword once, and ends up slicing down an entire squad of enemy soldiers with an invisible blade of magic. Or a brawler punches someone in the chest and sends a shockwave traveling through their body and out the other side. That's why it's called Expansion, it increases the effective size and range of what it is applied to. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T18:20:48-07:00","id":287056,"title":"","content":"Well, there is a goddess of Volcanoes; <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pele_(deity)\" target=\"_blank\">Pele</a><br /> <i><br /> In the Hawaiian religion, Pele is the goddess of volcanoes. She is a popular figure in many stories of ancient Hawaii known as Hawaiian mythology. Ka wahine \u02bbai honua (&quot;the earth-eating woman&quot;) is an epithet for the goddess.</i><br /> -----<br /> <br /> *shrug* Volcanoes, magma/lava, steam, earthquakes, the islands that form...a deity that is apparently all about offense. <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C4%ABlauea#Ancient_Hawaiian\" target=\"_blank\">Ancient Hawaii</a>; <i>K\u012blauea is the body of the deity Pele, goddess of fire, lightning, wind, and volcanoes.</i><br /> <br /> She is very scary.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-19T20:20:07-07:00","id":287180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/286124-purview-ideas?p=287056#post287056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, there is a goddess of Volcanoes; <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pele_(deity)\" target=\"_blank\">Pele</a><br /> <i><br /> In the Hawaiian religion, Pele is the goddess of volcanoes. She is a popular figure in many stories of ancient Hawaii known as Hawaiian mythology. Ka wahine \u02bbai honua (&quot;the earth-eating woman&quot;) is an epithet for the goddess.</i><br /> -----<br /> <br /> *shrug* Volcanoes, magma/lava, steam, earthquakes, the islands that form...a deity that is apparently all about offense. <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C4%ABlauea#Ancient_Hawaiian\" target=\"_blank\">Ancient Hawaii</a>; <i>K\u012blauea is the body of the deity Pele, goddess of fire, lightning, wind, and volcanoes.</i><br /> <br /> She is very scary.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was a tad disappointed when I looked up the purviews and the only thing I could find on Magma was that you can swim through it like water. There's been enough references to sacrificing virgins to volcanoes in popular media, I thought we needed to expand upon the idea of somebody in charge of seismic eruptions. If for no other reason than leading an army of Titan Spawn into a mine field. XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T03:10:26-07:00","id":287380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/286124-purview-ideas?p=286890#post286890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Well it wasn't just about growing big, it was also about increasing somebody's reach. Such as making attacks effect a large area, or to continue traveling long after they should have stopped. For example, a samurai swings their sword once, and ends up slicing down an entire squad of enemy soldiers with an invisible blade of magic. Or a brawler punches someone in the chest and sends a shockwave traveling through their body and out the other side. That's why it's called Expansion, it increases the effective size and range of what it is applied to. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> All of the purviews are supposed to be impressive in themselves, and they are part of a god's portfolio. Making things big doesn't really fit this category. I mean, having a god proudly declaring &quot;I am the god of big things!&quot; doesn't just sounds right to me.<br /> <br /> Besides, all the exemples you mentioned? It can be done with Epic Attributes. And the avatar you wrote clearly says Epic Strength.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T04:33:14-07:00","id":287445,"title":"","content":"This was a lovely entry written by Anne: <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 0px\"> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_midtext\" style=\"border-width: 0px; padding: 5px\"><i><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Pele </b></span><br /> Of all the goddesses of Hawaii, temperamental and fiery Pele is the most famous. The volcano goddess is a figure of enormous passions and even larger tantrums, and her stormy love affairs, violent sibling quarrels and boiling disastrous eruptions have been favorite stories of her people for centuries, retold with careful respect beneath the smoking craters of the mountains she calls home. Few even among the gods dare to anger Pele, who responds to any and all insults and affronts (even imagined ones) with immediate force and extreme prejudice.<br /> <br /> Pele is unignorable; when she enters the World, it is as a destructive, unconquerable force, upsetting, overturning and changing everything and everyone she comes into contact with. People are polarized towards her or left as debris in her wake, while all the events and situations immediately gain her as their central focus. She frequently appears as a firebrand marching in feminist rallies, a rebel leader stirring up riots against corrupt governments on the islands or a world champion surfer soaking up her fans' wild adoration.<br /> <br /> Scions of Pele are as passionate as their volatile mother, quick to love and even quicker to anger. They usually pursue what they want with gusto and seldom suffer insults or attacks on themselves without meting out appropriate retribution. despite their undeniable temper control problems, they can be fierce warriors in the defense of a cause they believe in and never back down, even when others might decide to cut their losses.<br /> <br /> <b>Associated Powers:</b> Chaos, Fire, Epic Charisma, Epic Perception.<br /> <b>Abilities:</b> Art, Athletics, Awareness, Control, Presence, Survival.</i></td> </tr> </table></div></td> </tr> </table></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-20T09:11:49-07:00","id":287715,"title":"","content":"Aww, well I guess its not necessary then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T22:47:37-07:00","id":450187,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see a blood purview, someday. I don't know of any fan made ones, so if there are any could someone let me know? But seriously, blood would be a good one especially for Aztec and Vodou gods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5417-supersam888","name":"SuperSam888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T23:26:39-07:00","id":450199,"title":"","content":"What would a Blood Purview do?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T05:29:03-07:00","id":450340,"title":"","content":"I have never made a purview before, so I will spit ball ideas.<br /> <br /> It could be have aspects of Bloodbending (manipulating someone by controlling their blood) like from Avatar, unholy blood magics like boiling blood to cause damage or freezing blood to hinder mobility, the ability to scry via blood, and even aspects of vampirism like consuming blood to gain the persons memories or to give a boost to attributes or even heal. You could also be able to track someone by smelling their blood. <br /> <br /> These are just some ideas.<br /> <br /> It could focus on one of these or combine some or all or be something entirely different. I will try to make a purview based on these ideas and feedback if I can, but I am relatively new to Scion and might not do it justice.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5417-supersam888","name":"SuperSam888","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T06:14:09-07:00","id":450352,"title":"","content":"It's like vampires making an attempt at recreating elements.<br /> But titans would only laugh, as many are representations of worldviews of such purviews. (The Greek Gods had ichor for blood. I recall a piece of fiction where Vulcan said he pisses lava. And speaking of which, many earth deities claim to have lava for blood. Which is fitting)<br /> It's like a huge downgrade of power in Scion.<br /> <br /> But really, &quot;blood&quot; I'm sure can easily be filed under the &quot;Health&quot; purview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T06:38:36-07:00","id":450383,"title":"","content":"It doesn't really scream... mythical to me.<br /> More like titanspawns's abilities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T06:41:50-07:00","id":450385,"title":"","content":"I'm reminded of the D&amp;D supplement to &quot;Ravenloft&quot; that made &quot;flesh,&quot; bone,&quot; and &quot;blood&quot; elements of a sort.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T12:29:33-07:00","id":450701,"title":"","content":"The passion purview is needed/desirable.<br /> <br /> Might I suggest a comunication/laguage purview? It's a common mythic theme, it may be hard to come up with higher level powers (Create/Destroy Language anyone?) but it fits the game.<br /> <br /> Music/Harmony would seem like a good choice for a purview. It has many mythic uses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/